<main id="main-content" class="form-page"><section class="content-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="section-label">PRODUCTS & PARTNERSHIPS</p><h1>Make an Enquiry</h1><p class="section-description">Tell us what you are interested in and we will prepare a summary of your enquiry. Availability and prices must be confirmed by the store.</p></div><form class="contact-form validated-form" id="enquiry-form" data-form-type="enquiry" novalidate><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-name">Full name *</label><input id="enquiry-name" name="name" type="text" minlength="2" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" required><small class="field-error"></small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-email">Email address *</label><input id="enquiry-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required><small class="field-error"></small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-kind">What is your enquiry about? *</label><select id="enquiry-kind" name="enquiryType" required><option value="">Select an option</option><option value="Casual wear">Casual wear</option><option value="Formal wear">Formal wear</option><option value="Sportswear">Sportswear</option><option value="Accessories">Accessories</option><option value="Sponsorship or partnership">Sponsorship or partnership</option><option value="Volunteering">Volunteering</option></select><small class="field-error"></small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-size">Size (if applicable)</label><select id="enquiry-size" name="size"><option value="Not applicable">Not applicable</option><option>XS</option><option>S</option><option>M</option><option>L</option><option>XL</option><option>XXL</option><option>Other / unsure</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-quantity">Estimated quantity (if applicable)</label><input id="enquiry-quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="500" value="1"><small class="field-error"></small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="enquiry-message">Additional details *</label><textarea id="enquiry-message" name="message" rows="5" minlength="5" maxlength="1000" required placeholder="Describe the item, event or opportunity you are asking about."></textarea><small class="field-error"></small></div><button type="submit">Check Enquiry & Prepare Email</button><p class="form-note">This is an enquiry request, not a confirmed order. Prices and stock are not live-connected to an inventory system.</p><div class="enquiry-result" id="enquiry-result" aria-live="polite" hidden></div><p class="form-feedback" id="enquiry-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-container"><div><h2>Princess Fashion Store</h2><p>Your One-Stop Shop for All Things Fashion.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="index.html#clothing">Clothing</a><a href="enquiry.html">Enquiries</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div></div><div class="copyright"><p>&copy; 2026 Princess Fashion Store. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><div class="toast" id="site-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></body></html>
